B.WA=new A.FD(!0,"# Privacy Policy \u2014 Specrails\n\n**Specrails does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data.**\n\n## What the app does\n\nSpecrails is a companion app for Specrails Desktop, a tool that runs on your own computer. The app connects directly to your computer over your local Wi-Fi network.\n\n## Data\n\n- **No accounts.** The app has no sign-up, login, or user profiles.\n- **No analytics.** The app contains no analytics, tracking, or advertising SDKs.\n- **No cloud.** All communication happens directly between your phone and your computer on your local network, encrypted with TLS and certificate pinning. Nothing is sent to us or to any third party.\n- **Local storage only.** The pairing credential is stored in your device's secure keychain and never leaves the device. You can remove it at any time (Settings \u2192 Unpair).\n- **Camera.** The camera is used only to scan the pairing QR code shown by Specrails Desktop. No images are stored or transmitted.\n\n## Contact\n\nQuestions? Open an issue at github.com/fjpulidop or write to the address listed on specrails.dev.\n",!1,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,B.yc,B.yd,!0,B.yl,!0,null)
